  "content": "\n\n<p>這是列於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/CyclopsMC</a> 之模組所需的函式庫模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/9yDxubB\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cyclops Discord 伺服器</a> 的 #cyclopscore 頻道與我們交流！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組允許您透過 XML 宣告自訂配方，更多詳細資訊請見&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/CyclopsCore/wiki/Recipe-XML\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/packages/packages/\" rel=\"nofollow\">開發版本</a> 已託管為 GitHub Packages。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組&nbsp;會收集 <a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/CyclopsCore/blob/master-1.9/src/main/java/org/cyclops/cyclopscore/tracking/Analytics.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">匿名啟動資料</a>，您可以在設定檔中將其關閉，且其運作機制符合 Minecraft 的偵測程式（snooper）設定。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcyclops\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/banner/console-affiliation-banners/banner_abd7c360-8f9d-4395-8382-b28f26a2d6b2.png\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a><br>使用推薦碼 <strong>cyclops</strong> 於 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcyclops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 租用伺服器以支持我們，即可享有<strong>首月 25% 折扣</strong>！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kroeser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c14.patreon.com/Patreon_Wordmark_fb38c295a1.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"56\"></a><br>如果您喜歡此模組，歡迎考慮在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kroeser\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上支持我！</p>",
